othing in the source provides evidence that there is no relationship between socio-cultural ideal BMI and group-level BMI (or that such a relationship exists). Therefore the claim of \\"NONE\\" is unsupported by these citations."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "Not supported"}', 'motivation': "I don't know", 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'Not supported', 'perplexity': 1.0070162023995846, 'mean_token_prob': 0.9932266511675436, 'min_prob': 0.9324929984943345, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0014325903906502397, 'prob_variance': 0.00037117879530207463, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.06800226062814291, 'avg_nll': 0.006991703378172464}

